From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:54:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 127/147] hjviewer: the desktop by keyboard, with a visible
 focus ring (UX-K1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

UX-K1 (U25):
- PC cards are Tab stops (common/hjv_keys.dart's HjvPeerCardKeys): Enter
  connects, the menu key and Shift+F10 open the card's menu at its top
  right, F2 and Delete do the card menu's rename and remove where that
  menu offers them, Space chooses while several are being chosen. The
  focused card draws the hover's 2 px border. The mouse is unchanged.
- The card's ⋮ (desktop and phone), the connect box's ▾, the PC list's
  view and sort buttons and the session tab list open their menus under
  the button when a key presses them (HjvMenuAnchor), not at the
  screen's corner.
- One focus ring: the theme's Elevated, Outlined and Text buttons get a
  2 px border while focused (the accent; the text colour on a filled
  button), and the app's own widgets draw the same ring (HjvFocusRing):
  tab pills, their close buttons, window and tab bar buttons, the
  settings side bar, the PC list's pills and icon buttons. Icon-only
  pills and buttons show their tooltip on the keyboard's focus too.
- The main window: Ctrl+F (Cmd+F) opens and focuses the PC list's
  search on the home tab, Ctrl+W (Cmd+W) closes the settings tab;
  main.dart's key listener is never a Tab stop. The connect box and
  the PC list are focus traversal groups.
- Desktop tooltips wait 500 ms. The radio menus' decorative checks
  are not Tab stops.
- The ID suggestions: Up and Down mark the chosen row on the accent's
  soft tint, Enter then connects to that PC, and the footer says so
  ('Enter 키: 고른 PC에 연결').

D4 (1.8.2 screen review carry-over): [연결] and ▾ sit beside the
remote ID field, as high as it, so that the suggestions under the field
cover neither.

UX-S2 open point (style2): the desktop connect button is hjvButton with
HjvButtonSize.screen.

Test: flutter/test/hjviewer_keys_test.dart (pure, no bridge).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
